  {
   "id": "zn_t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 788,
   "y": 183,
   "width": 544,
   "height": 135,
   "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100008,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700056,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "znode:\n    path             UNIQUE\n    data             <= a size cap\n    type             PERSISTENT | EPHEMERAL\n    sequential       bool\n    ephemeralOwner   sessionId | null\n    version          optimistic-concurrency counter\n    czxid / mzxid    the GLOBAL write-order ids\n    children         DERIVED from the path prefix",
   "originalText": "znode:\n    path             UNIQUE\n    data             <= a size cap\n    type             PERSISTENT | EPHEMERAL\n    sequential       bool\n    ephemeralOwner   sessionId | null\n    version          optimistic-concurrency counter\n    czxid / mzxid    the GLOBAL write-order ids\n    children         DERIVED from the path prefix",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "zn",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "an",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1390,
   "y": 146,
   "width": 204,
   "height": 240,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100009,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700063,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "There is no separate\n'children' table: a node's\nchildren come directly from\nthe tree structure, the way\na real filesystem does not\nstore a directory listing\nas a separate database.\n\nczxid and mzxid are the\ncreation and last-\nmodification transaction\nids - the same ordering\ntoken the consensus layer\nalready assigns to every\ncommitted write, reused\nrather than invented.",
   "originalText": "There is no separate\n'children' table: a node's\nchildren come directly from\nthe tree structure, the way\na real filesystem does not\nstore a directory listing\nas a separate database.\n\nczxid and mzxid are the\ncreation and last-\nmodification transaction\nids - the same ordering\ntoken the consensus layer\nalready assigns to every\ncommitted write, reused\nrather than invented.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
