  {
   "id": "dn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 770,
   "y": 982,
   "width": 599,
   "height": 45,
   "strokeColor": "#047857",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100040,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700280,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "One failure - a client goes silent - has exactly ONE resolution: session expiry,\nwhich deletes EVERY ephemeral node and clears EVERY watch that client owned,\natomically, in one server-side pass.",
   "originalText": "One failure - a client goes silent - has exactly ONE resolution: session expiry,\nwhich deletes EVERY ephemeral node and clears EVERY watch that client owned,\natomically, in one server-side pass.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "dn2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 770,
   "y": 1050,
   "width": 599,
   "height": 75,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100041,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700287,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A per-primitive TTL would mean a client holding all three simultaneously needs\nthree independent renewal loops, three timeout policies, and three ways to\nHALF-FAIL - renewing the lock's TTL but missing the leadership TTL because of a\nslow thread, say. Here the lease IS the session, and everything it owns rides on\nthat one lease together.",
   "originalText": "A per-primitive TTL would mean a client holding all three simultaneously needs\nthree independent renewal loops, three timeout policies, and three ways to\nHALF-FAIL - renewing the lock's TTL but missing the leadership TTL because of a\nslow thread, say. Here the lease IS the session, and everything it owns rides on\nthat one lease together.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d5",
   "type": "line",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1150,
   "width": 1680,
   "height": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#cbd5e1",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100042,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700294,
   "isDeleted": false,
